{{wikispecies|Salmo gairdneri}}
===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|rainbow trout}}

# {{cx|usually|countable|lang=en}} A [[trout]] of the species ''[[Oncorhynchus mykiss]]'', that has black spots and a pink streak running along the body.
# {{cx|usually|uncountable|lang=en}} The fish as food.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|''Oncorhynchus mykiss''}} [[hardhead]], {{vern|redband trout}}, [[salmon trout]], {{vern|silver trout}}, [[steelhead]]

